msgid "My workstation install has been through several Mint upgrades and I think the upgrade from 21.3 to 22 had problems and I had to restore from backup. That computer is on Mint 22.1 now and still has the problem, even though KeePassXC accesses GVFS stuff fine. I am not sure when the problem started.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/problem-importing-from-network-location.md:84
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "My other computer which runs Mint 21.3 accesses the network shares fine, I wonder if it's some configuration file or something that went wrong during an upgrade.\n"
