#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Even if unprobable, exclude that the issue is due to a local problem. If someone following this discussion can test my image (at own risk of course) on a latest Ventura 13.3.1 arm64 system, that would be great: [https://filedn.com/lxq2oIO61Rdjuk1dvBFLayu/Ansel-v0.0.0%2B297~g092df1dfe-arm64.dmg](https://filedn.com/lxq2oIO61Rdjuk1dvBFLayu/Ansel-v0.0.0%2B297~g092df1dfe-arm64.dmg)\n"
