#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/ansel-on-mac.md:93
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**erik** — 2023-05-03\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/ansel-on-mac.md:95
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Thanks for giving it a try. It is not unlikely that I stuffed up somewhere and built using a shared library or something. If the build complains that it is missing libgmic then I assume it won’t work for anybody else either. I will take a look on my side as well.\n"
