#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/ansel-on-mac.md:107
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Short news (2): I solved my issue: The mouse double click setting in macos was shifted to \"slow\". This was translated in GTK+ (gtk-double-click-time) with a value of 1800 ms... that's really slow. Back to default value and the issue is gone.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/ansel-on-mac.md:109
