#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/where-may-i-find-darktable-4-0-1-binaries.md:169
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The commit for the 4.0.1 version (2022-9-18) Is: ffe32b5c29648562b2c400c4bf3df2832ca165a216ea6292e5a741f7e353955b\n"
