#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:38
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "But I really hope that Ansel develops well and that I get value for the donation I have made so far, even if I don't get access to what would have been included in a premium membership.\n"
