#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:70
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Magnus Berg** — 2025-05-01\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:72
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Thanks for that, Jon. After your explanation, I realize that my loss was negligible.\n"
