#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:38
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"-  git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/aurelienpierreeng/ansel.git\n"
"- cd ansel\n"
"-  git submodule init\n"
"-  git submodule update\n"
