msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/select-same-month-every-year-and-timetable.md:60
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "I just realized that if instead of (for example) \"2022:03\" you write \":03:\" you select all the pictures taken in March of every year, exactly what I needed :)\n"
