#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:10
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From March 2023 to May 2025, Ansel ran a community forum at `community.ansel.photos`. In June\n"
"2025 it was taken offline: the site had been compromised and a counterfeit site was being served\n"
"from inside the forum software, so the whole installation had to be removed.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:16
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The discussions themselves survived, in a database dump. This section republishes the ones worth\n"
"keeping — problems reported and solved, questions about the software, user stories and feedback,\n"
"and the decisions taken along the way with the reasoning behind them. They are read-only and\n"
"unedited apart from formatting, and each page keeps its original address so old links and search\n"
"results still lead somewhere.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:21
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most pages link to a snapshot of the original in the Internet Archive, so you can check this copy\n"
"against the forum as it stood. Six threads here exist in no database at all: they had already been\n"
"deleted from the forum before the final dump, and survive only because a crawler had captured\n"
"them.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:25
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two things to keep in mind while reading: answers may refer to versions of Ansel that have since\n"
"changed, and **image attachments are gone** — they lived on the forum's own server, which did not\n"
"survive the shutdown.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:29
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Member introductions and forum housekeeping are not republished, but nothing was thrown away:\n"
"the complete export is kept privately, and any thread left out of this section can be restored on\n"
"request.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:31
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Current discussion happens on\n"
"[GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/aurelienpierreeng/ansel/discussions).\n"
msgstr ""

