#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/drawn-mask-covers-entire-screen-what-am-i.md:78
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You have the selection inverted it seems, and everything is yellos, selected so it seems your selection is not selecting anything.\n"
