"{{< plotly title=\"Magenta sun : row profile through the deepest clipped pixel, per channel ; the all-clip core's dome cross-section.\" src=\"cf-parade-magentasun.json\" caption=\"true\" >}}\n"
"{{< figure src=\"./cf-sweep-correlated.png\" caption=\"Correlated gradients.\" />}}\n"
